  "content": {
    "id": "p19-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "In a bus, $\\frac{2}{7}$ of the passengers are male. What is the ratio of the number of male passengers to the number of female passengers?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2:5$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Fraction of female passengers}&=1-\\frac{2}{7}\\\\\\text{Fraction of female passengers}&=\\frac{5}{7}\\end{align*}$$\n\nDivide the passengers into $7$ equal parts: $2$ parts are male and $5$ parts are female.\n\n$$\\text{Male passengers}:\\text{female passengers}=2:5.$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 26
